###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}4\blueE{t}-1\blueE{t}+\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=(4-1)\blueE{t}+\goldE{2}
\\\\
&=3\blueE{t}+\goldE{2}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $3\blueE{t}+\goldE{2}$ since they aren't like terms.
